{"seq":1,"slug":"bonded-repair-material-record","title":"维修保税料件备案与专用账册","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-maintenance-repair-reexport/bonded-material-ledger/bonded-repair-material-record","wordCount":2178,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"维修保税料件备案与专用账册\">维修保税料件备案与专用账册</h1><p>维修用到的料件从哪来？普通售后维修的答案是&quot;从仓库领&quot;，保税维修的答案要复杂一层——仓库里同时躺着<strong>保税料件</strong>和<strong>非保税料件</strong>两种板子，它们外观一样、型号一样、可以互换使用，但记账方式完全不同。用错了，一笔本该随着整机出境的暂缓税款就会变成漏缴；用反了，一块本该补税的料件会被错当作保税料件核销掉。监管对此的解法不是在仓库门口设卡，而是要求企业把两类料件放进<strong>同一套账册的不同科目</strong>，用账簿结构而不是物理隔离来约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>监管规则要求保税维修企业设立<strong>保税维修专用账（手）册</strong>，并建立待维修货物、已维修货物、无法维修货物的电子底账；如果以保税方式进口料件，账册还应包含<strong>料件底账</strong>（<a href=\"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2018-12/31/content_5447554.htm\">海关总署公告2018年第203号</a>）。这四个科目不是并列的台账，而是同一批货物在生命周期中的四个货位：一台机器进境时进待维修底账，修好进已维修底账，修不了进无法维修底账；而换上去的料件走独立的料件底账，换下来的旧件坏件走处置科目。</p>\n<p>关键定调在于核销方法：保税进口的维修用料件须&quot;实施以<strong>维修工单</strong>为基础的<strong>据实核销</strong>&quot;。这句话决定了账册的数据底座——账册的数字不能靠期末盘出来，而必须由<strong>每一张工单的实际领用记录</strong>累加而成。这与加工贸易的单耗核销形成鲜明对照：单耗核销假设&quot;出一件成品固定耗用 N 个料件&quot;，可以用产量反推耗用；维修没有固定单耗，同一型号的机器可能换板也可能不换，<strong>唯一可靠的耗用证据是工单本身</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[保税料件进境] --&gt; B[料件底账备案]&#10;  C[待维修货物进境] --&gt; D[待维修底账]&#10;  D --&gt; E[生成维修工单]&#10;  B --&gt; F[工单领料&lt;br/&gt;据实扣减]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G{维修结果}&#10;  G --&gt;|修复| H[已维修底账]&#10;  G --&gt;|不可修| I[无法维修底账]&#10;  F --&gt; J[替换下旧件坏件&lt;br/&gt;处置科目]&#10;  H --&gt; K[复运出境核销]&#10;  B --&gt; L[剩余料件&lt;br/&gt;结转或补税]\">graph TD\n  A[保税料件进境] --&gt; B[料件底账备案]\n  C[待维修货物进境] --&gt; D[待维修底账]\n  D --&gt; E[生成维修工单]\n  B --&gt; F[工单领料&lt;br/&gt;据实扣减]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G{维修结果}\n  G --&gt;|修复| H[已维修底账]\n  G --&gt;|不可修| I[无法维修底账]\n  F --&gt; J[替换下旧件坏件&lt;br/&gt;处置科目]\n  H --&gt; K[复运出境核销]\n  B --&gt; L[剩余料件&lt;br/&gt;结转或补税]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>账册科目</th>\n<th>记录对象</th>\n<th>数量单位</th>\n<th>核销依据</th>\n<th>期末去向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>待维修底账</td>\n<td>进境缺陷货物</td>\n<td>台/件（按序列号）</td>\n<td>进出记录</td>\n<td>转已维修或无法维修</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已维修底账</td>\n<td>修复完成货物</td>\n<td>台/件</td>\n<td>复出境记录</td>\n<td>复运出境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无法维修底账</td>\n<td>判定不可修货物</td>\n<td>台/件</td>\n<td>销毁或复出记录</td>\n<td>销毁/复运出境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>料件底账</td>\n<td>保税维修用料件</td>\n<td>个/块（按料号）</td>\n<td><strong>工单据实核销</strong></td>\n<td>随整机出境或补税</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>处置科目</td>\n<td>旧件坏件边角料</td>\n<td>个/千克</td>\n<td>处置凭证</td>\n<td>复出/征税内销/销毁</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"料件备案的字段设计\">料件备案的字段设计</h2><h3 id=\"备案商品与加工贸易禁止类的关系\">备案商品与加工贸易禁止类的关系</h3><p>备案不是把商品编码抄一遍。规则的措辞值得琢磨：<strong>备案商品不纳入加工贸易禁止类商品目录管理</strong>。这是一个重要的口径澄清——维修用保税料件虽然以保税方式进口、并按进料加工（0615）或来料加工（0214）的监管方式申报，但它<strong>不受加工贸易禁止类目录的约束</strong>。原因是二者监管理由不同：加工贸易禁止类针对的是&quot;以加工贸易形式生产并内销&quot;的产业政策风险，而保税维修料件的最终去向被&quot;复运出境&quot;这一承诺锁住，不存在同类风险。</p>\n<p>对系统而言，这条口径意味着<strong>备案校验规则不能直接复用加工贸易的禁止类清单</strong>。如果误用，会把一批合法可修的料件挡在门外；这是典型的&quot;看起来像所以共用一套校验&quot;的架构错误。</p>\n<h3 id=\"备案编码规则\">备案编码规则</h3><p>备案时的填报规则是硬性的，直接影响后续所有申报能否对上。表头监管方式填<strong>保税维修（1371）</strong>，保税方式填<strong>保税维修（5）</strong>；周转金额依生产能力和合同自行确定。成品备案为&quot;<strong>货物品名（已修复）</strong>&quot;&quot;<strong>货物品名（无法修复）</strong>&quot;；料件备案为&quot;<strong>货物品名（待修复）</strong>&quot;和&quot;<strong>维修用保税料件</strong>&quot;（后者据实填报）。</p>\n<p>这套命名规则背后是一个重要的建模决定：<strong>&quot;待修复&quot;的整机在账册里是以料件形态备案的</strong>，而维修的产出（已修复/无法修复）以成品形态备案。也就是说，一台进境的待修机器，在账册上&quot;进来时是料、出去时是成品&quot;——这与加工贸易的料件→成品转换同构，也正是为什么它的申报能复用进料加工/来料加工的监管方式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 保税维修专用账册的科目结构&#10;CREATE TABLE repair_ledger_book (&#10;  book_id        text PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  ledger_owner   text NOT NULL,&#10;  ledger_type    text NOT NULL,              -- E 账册 / H 手册&#10;  customs_code   text NOT NULL,              -- 主管海关&#10;  established_at date NOT NULL,&#10;  cycle_start    date NOT NULL,&#10;  cycle_end      date NOT NULL,&#10;  status         text NOT NULL,&#10;  CONSTRAINT chk_status CHECK (status IN (&#39;ACTIVE&#39;,&#39;SUSPENDED&#39;,&#39;CLOSED&#39;))&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE repair_ledger_item (&#10;  item_id        text PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  book_id        text NOT NULL REFERENCES repair_ledger_book(book_id),&#10;  subject        text NOT NULL,              -- GOODS_WAIT / GOODS_FIXED / GOODS_UNFIX&#10;  hs_code        text NOT NULL,&#10;  item_name      text NOT NULL,              -- 货物品名（待修复）等&#10;  unit           text NOT NULL,&#10;  declared_qty   numeric(18,4) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  current_qty    numeric(18,4) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  is_bonded_material boolean NOT NULL,       -- 维修用保税料件&#10;  CONSTRAINT chk_subject CHECK (&#10;    subject IN (&#39;GOODS_WAIT&#39;,&#39;GOODS_FIXED&#39;,&#39;GOODS_UNFIX&#39;,&#39;MATERIAL&#39;,&#39;SCRAP&#39;))&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_item_book_subject ON repair_ledger_item(book_id, subject);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 保税维修专用账册的科目结构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> repair_ledger_book</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  book_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ledger_owner   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ledger_type    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- E 账册 / H 手册</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  customs_code   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 主管海关</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  established_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cycle_start    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cycle_end      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chk_status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ACTIVE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SUSPENDED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CLOSED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> repair_ledger_item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  item_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  book_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repair_ledger_book(book_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  subject</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- GOODS_WAIT / GOODS_FIXED / GOODS_UNFIX</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  hs_code        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  item_name      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 货物品名（待修复）等</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  unit           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  declared_qty   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  current_qty    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  is_bonded_material </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">boolean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 维修用保税料件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chk_subject </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    subject</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'GOODS_WAIT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'GOODS_FIXED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'GOODS_UNFIX'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'MATERIAL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SCRAP'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_item_book_subject</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repair_ledger_item(book_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">subject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>subject</code> 字段把四类货位显式建模，而不是靠命名约定区分。这一点在多账册并行时尤其重要——第 4 章的盘点与差异归因需要按科目汇总，命名约定是无法可靠聚合的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"周转金额与账册容量\">周转金额与账册容量</h2><p>备案时要填的<strong>周转金额</strong>是一个容易设错的参数。规则说它&quot;依生产能力和合同自行确定&quot;——这句话把决定权交给企业，但也意味着设错没有兜底。周转金额设得偏低，会出现&quot;有单开不出&quot;的业务停摆；设得偏高，会让账册的额度与实际业务量脱节，在核查时难以解释。</p>\n<p>一个可用的估算是以<strong>峰值在修量 × 单台价值</strong>为基础，再乘以一个覆盖核销周期的系数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>turnover</mtext></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>V</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>unit</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{\\text{turnover}} \\ge \\bar{V}_{\\text{unit}} \\times Q_{\\text{peak}} \\times \\left(1 + \\alpha\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">turnover</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9701em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">unit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>V</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>unit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{V}_{\\text{unit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9701em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">unit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单台货物的平均申报价值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{peak}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是核销周期内的峰值在修数量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 是留白系数。留白的必要性来自维修周期的不确定性：一台设备原计划 15 天修好，实际因料件等待拖到 60 天，它会占用额度的时间远超预期。把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 设为零等于假设每台设备都按计划完工，这在维修业务里是不成立的假设。</p>\n<h2 id=\"账册与工单的桥接\">账册与工单的桥接</h2><p>账册与工单的关系是这套系统的核心接口。工单是耗用事实的载体，账册是耗用事实的汇总投影。两者之间必须<strong>单向派生</strong>——账册从工单派生，而不是反过来。若允许手工调账，账册数字就会脱离事实，第 4 章的差异归因也就无从下手。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>生成物</th>\n<th>是否可人工修改</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>料件进境</td>\n<td>报关单</td>\n<td>料件底账增加</td>\n<td>否（以单证为准）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工单领料</td>\n<td>工单系统</td>\n<td>料件底账扣减</td>\n<td>否（据实核销）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工单完工</td>\n<td>工单系统</td>\n<td>待维修→已维修转移</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>旧件登记</td>\n<td>工单系统</td>\n<td>处置科目增加</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>盘点调整</td>\n<td>盘点任务</td>\n<td>差异记录 + 待审批调整</td>\n<td><strong>是（需审批留痕）</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>期末核销</td>\n<td>汇总计算</td>\n<td>核销报告</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>is_bonded_material</code> 这个布尔字段在工单领料时承担关键职责。仓库里同型号的板子可能既有保税也有非保税，领料时必须在字段层面区分，否则扣减会扣错科目。稳妥的做法是让<strong>料号本身就编码保税属性</strong>（同一型号的保税与非保税用不同料号），把区分前移到物料主数据，而不是依赖仓管员在领料时的判断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>保税维修专用账册包含四类货位（待维修、已维修、无法维修、料件），另加处置科目记录旧件坏件与边角料；它们是同一批货在生命周期中的不同位置。</li>\n<li>保税料件必须&quot;以维修工单为基础的据实核销&quot;，而非单耗核销——维修没有固定单耗，工单是唯一可靠的耗用证据。</li>\n<li>备案商品不纳入加工贸易禁止类商品目录管理，备案校验规则不可直接复用加工贸易清单。</li>\n<li>备案编码有固定规则：待修复整机以料件形态备案、已修复与无法修复以成品形态备案，监管方式 1371、保税方式 5。</li>\n<li>周转金额应按峰值在修量加留白估算；账册数字必须单向派生自工单，只允许盘点差异走审批调整。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一篇 <a href=\"repair-workorder-material-consume\">维修工单与料件耗用扣减（联181）</a> 会把工单这条数据链拆开，讲清工单在什么时候生成、料件如何据实扣减、以及扣减与申报如何在同一事实上不打架。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"维修保税料件备案与专用账册","id":"维修保税料件备案与专用账册"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"料件备案的字段设计","id":"料件备案的字段设计"},{"level":3,"text":"备案商品与加工贸易禁止类的关系","id":"备案商品与加工贸易禁止类的关系"},{"level":3,"text":"备案编码规则","id":"备案编码规则"},{"level":2,"text":"周转金额与账册容量","id":"周转金额与账册容量"},{"level":2,"text":"账册与工单的桥接","id":"账册与工单的桥接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"境内外品牌方委托维修架构（联057）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-maintenance-repair-reexport/bonded-repair-qualification-scope/brand-principal-entrust-structure"},"next":{"title":"维修工单与料件耗用扣减（联181）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-maintenance-repair-reexport/bonded-material-ledger/repair-workorder-material-consume"}}